license: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
repository-code: "https://github.com/PinaGruden/TDOA_tracking_master"
abstract: >-
  TDOA_tracking_master is a MATLAB package for multi-target tracking of
  time-differences-of-arrival (TDOAs) of acoustic signals between two sensors.
  It was developed and tested for towed hydrophone arrays and can also be
  used with stationary arrays. The package computes generalized
  cross-correlograms from multichannel recordings of clicks, whistles or
  both, extracts TDOA measurements, and links them into continuous
  trajectories using a Gaussian mixture probability hypothesis density
  filter (GM-PHD-SA) that handles multiple simultaneous sources, clutter and
  missed detections. Filter parameters and birth priors were optimized on
  training data. Output tracks are used directly by the companion package
  Localization_Towed_Array for localizing sources.
keywords:
  - passive acoustic monitoring
  - multi-target tracking
  - time difference of arrival
  - marine mammals
  - MATLAB
